### Runnable examples of every route, for the VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### First: python scripts/api_check.py --keep-running --data-dir <folder outside OneDrive>
### Expected results are in the comments; scripts/api_check.py checks them automatically.

@search = http://localhost:7003
@ingestion = http://localhost:7001
@indexing = http://localhost:7002
@control = http://localhost:7000

### ---------- Front-end ----------

### 200, total 4, ranked by BM25: "adventure" is in four fixture books
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure

### 200, one filter
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure&language=en

### 200, author filter ignores case
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure&author=CARROLL

### 200, year filter
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure&year=1865

### 200, all filters combined, total 1
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure&author=carroll&language=en&year=1865

### 200, several terms must all match
GET {{search}}/search?q=white%20rabbit

### 200, diacritics are optional: finds Don Quijote
GET {{search}}/search?q=espana&language=es

### 200, empty results
GET {{search}}/search?q=unicorn

### 200, second page of two results; total stays 4
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure&limit=2&offset=2

### 400 missing_query
GET {{search}}/search

### 400 invalid_year
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure&year=18x3

### 400 invalid_limit
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure&limit=1000

### 400 unknown_parameter
GET {{search}}/search?q=adventure&lang=en

### 200, values for filter controls
GET {{search}}/search/filters

### 200, book details
GET {{search}}/books/1342

### 404 book_not_found
GET {{search}}/books/999999

### ---------- Internal ----------

### 200 already_available: the fixture book was ingested during start-up
POST {{ingestion}}/ingest/1342

### 200 status available, with path, sizes and checksum
GET {{ingestion}}/ingest/status/1342

### 200 status not_ingested
GET {{ingestion}}/ingest/status/8888

### 200 list of available books
GET {{ingestion}}/ingest/list

### 422 invalid_book_format: this fixture has no Gutenberg markers
POST {{ingestion}}/ingest/9050

### 404 book_not_found: the local stand-in serves IDs up to 20000
POST {{ingestion}}/ingest/99999

### 200 unchanged: already indexed with the same content
POST {{indexing}}/index/update/1342

### 409 book_not_ready: ingestion has not completed for this book
POST {{indexing}}/index/update/8888

### 200 statistics
GET {{indexing}}/index/status

### 200 indexed
GET {{indexing}}/index/status/1342

### ---------- Operational and administrative ----------

### 202: known books are not processed again
POST {{control}}/control/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"book_ids": [1342, 84]}

### 400 invalid_body
POST {{control}}/control/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"book_ids": "not a list"}

### 200 state PUBLISHED, with timings
GET {{control}}/control/books/1342

### 409 task_not_failed
POST {{control}}/control/books/1342/retry

### 200 counts per state
GET {{control}}/control/status

### 200 books_processed: rebuilds the datamart atomically
POST {{indexing}}/index/rebuild

### 200 liveness and thread configuration
GET {{search}}/status
